# The portfolio lives at the root now. /apps is kept alive as a real edge
# redirect because it is published in seven places (an insights article, three
# case studies, /resources and /ar/resources). Astro.redirect() cannot be used
# here: this build is static, so it emits a 2s meta-refresh page instead of a
# real redirect, which is visible to the user as an unstyled flash.
/apps       /                               301
/apps/*     /                               301

# Redirect deprecated pages to wojciech.io equivalents
/cv         https://wojciech.io/cv          301
/contact    https://wojciech.io/contact     301
/timeline   https://wojciech.io/timeline    301
/status     https://wojciech.io/status      301
